'''Jon Snow''' is the bastard son of [[Eddard Stark]]. He becomes [[Lord Commander of the Night's Watch]].

==History==
Jon was raised at [[Winterfell]] alongside his half-siblings, including [[Robb Stark]].

==Recent Events==
===A Game of Thrones===
Jon joins the [[Night's Watch]] at [[Castle Black]].
===A Storm of Swords===
Jon is elected [[Lord Commander of the Night's Watch]].
